{"id":"n79575-1-7","stage":4,"title":"치우치다 · 倾向","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n79575-1-7-1","ko":"뒤에서 봐 줘. 균형 잘 맞아?","zh":"在后面帮我看着点。平衡还行吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"뒤에서","meaning":"后，后面","explanation":"뒤：后，后面；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"뒤","audio":"/audio/c65326b2de936236c222.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67477","senseId":"1","lemma":"뒤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"봐","meaning":"照，看","explanation":"보다：照，看；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"25","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"줘.","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","explanation":"주다：为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"균형","meaning":"平衡，均衡","explanation":"균형：平衡，均衡","readings":[{"term":"균형","audio":"/audio/634269a095ddb1b1dd57.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37056","senseId":"1","lemma":"균형","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잘","meaning":"好好地，顺利地","explanation":"잘：好好地，顺利地","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"4","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"맞아?","meaning":"合，合适","explanation":"맞다：合，合适；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"맞다","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66231","senseId":"7","lemma":"맞다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c65326b2de936236","term":"뒤","zh":"后，后面","audio":"/audio/c65326b2de936236c222.mp3","entryId":"67477","definition":"朝向的反方向。","pronunciation":["뒤ː"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"照，看","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"为了了解某对象的内容或状态而进行观察。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"77245","definition":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","pronunciation":["주다"]},{"id":"634269a095ddb1b1","term":"균형","zh":"平衡，均衡","audio":"/audio/634269a095ddb1b1dd57.mp3","entryId":"37056","definition":"不倾向或不偏重任何一方的状态。","pronunciation":["균형"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"好好地，顺利地","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"没有任何问题而舒服地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"6d08580e9b088153","term":"맞다","zh":"合，合适","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3","entryId":"66231","definition":"大小或规格等与某对象一致。","pronunciation":["맏따"]}],"audio":"/audio/20ca4af50d004ca1a7c2.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n79575-1-7-2","ko":"오른쪽으로 치우쳤어. 오른쪽을 좀 올려 봐.","zh":"往右边偏了。把右边往上提一点吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오른쪽으로","meaning":"右侧，右边","explanation":"오른쪽：右侧，右边；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"오른쪽","audio":"/audio/f594aa6a15b9381c0df7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17252","senseId":"1","lemma":"오른쪽","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"치우쳤어.","meaning":"倾向，侧重，偏重","explanation":"치우치다：倾向，侧重，偏重；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"치우치다","audio":"/audio/c44c666252366572042b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79575","senseId":"1","lemma":"치우치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"오른쪽을","meaning":"右侧，右边","explanation":"오른쪽：右侧，右边；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"오른쪽","audio":"/audio/f594aa6a15b9381c0df7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17252","senseId":"1","lemma":"오른쪽","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"올려","meaning":"拉上，卷上，拉起，提起","explanation":"올리다：拉上，卷上，拉起，提起；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"올리다","audio":"/audio/ff5095d829513a79ee33.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"22109","senseId":"3","lemma":"올리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"봐.","meaning":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","explanation":"보다：试着做（-아/어 보다）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"f594aa6a15b9381c","term":"오른쪽","zh":"右侧，右边","audio":"/audio/f594aa6a15b9381c0df7.mp3","entryId":"17252","definition":"人面向北边时和东边相同的一侧。","pronunciation":["오른쪽"]},{"id":"c44c666252366572","term":"치우치다","zh":"倾向，侧重，偏重","audio":"/audio/c44c666252366572042b.mp3","entryId":"79575","definition":"向一边倾斜或聚集。","pronunciation":["치우치다"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"ff5095d829513a79","term":"올리다","zh":"拉上，卷上，拉起，提起","audio":"/audio/ff5095d829513a79ee33.mp3","entryId":"22109","definition":"从下向上，使变高。","pronunciation":["올리다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62171","definition":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/402845cf5f57197a6a95.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.79,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=79575","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":134,"sequenceScore":2.6167,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["往右边偏了。把右边往上提一点吧。","在后面帮我看着点。平衡还行吗？","这条高速公路为什么突然被封闭了？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["在后面帮我看着点。平衡还行吗？","这条高速公路为什么突然被封闭了？","往右边偏了。把右边往上提一点吧。"],"answer":2}]}
